{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","name_native":"সুনান আন-নাসায়ী","section":{"24":"The Book of Hajj"},"section_detail":{"24":{"hadithnumber_first":2619,"hadithnumber_last":3084,"arabicnumber_first":2619,"arabicnumber_last":3084,"name_native":"হজ্জের কিতাব"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2846,"arabicnumber":2846,"text":"কুতায়বা (রহঃ) ... ইবন আব্বাস (রাঃ) থেকে বর্ণিত যে, রাসূলুল্লাহ সাল্লাল্লাহু আলাইহি ওয়াসাল্লাম ইহরাম অবস্থায় শিংগা লাগিয়েছিলেন।","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih - Agreed Upon"}],"reference":{"book":24,"hadith":229}}]}